          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí umer'ín kana leelehhiít baraá tlahhi'iiwo ala kaa slayká, gawaá adoorihe inooín kiri sií' harafaarooro tawa kaahamuuse, asma inooín kin harmeetín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga/aawusmo giri báy, inooín i harina'aaká muruú /aymaadá' hhohhó' nguwa /ayiya' ay dír kaahamusmoó Mungú nay hardihi ado ngiri oo' ar loohír Urimu nee Tumimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí sleémeero dinkwaaro a muu kume mibeeri tsiyáhh nee tsár nee tsiire tám nee mibeeri lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám dinkwa nee tihe lawaalér sagadiyuusér hhawaate nee /ameena i deer, inooín a kume faanqw tsiire tám mibeeri tám nee faanqw. Nee daauuse hhawaate nee /ameenaaro a tsiire tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farsuuín a tsiire faanqw mibeeri tám nee lahhoó', wayshamaín a tsiire tsár mibeeri tsiyáhh nee kooán, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angamiaduuín a tsiire tsiyáhh mibeeri tám nee kooán, nee daqwaayer'ín a kume lahhoó' tsiire faanqw nee mibeeri tsár.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.67"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
